[parameters: {'translation__0': 'नाम प्रसाद संभु अबिनासी, साजु अमंगल मंगल रासी। सुक सनकादि सिद्ध मुनि जोगी, नाम प्रसाद ब्रह्मसुख भोगी। नारद जानेउ नाम प्रतापू, जग प्रिय हरि हरि हर प्रिय आपू। नामु जपत प्रभु कीन्ह प्रसादू, भगत सिरोमनि भे प्रहलादू। ध्रुवँ सगलानि जपेउ हरि नाऊँ, पायउ अचल अनूपम ठाऊँ।', 'generated_by__0': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__0': 'Hindi', 'id__0': '30a80d40-c552-45da-b20d-871f9a12aea2', 'text_id__0': 'c5f2a19c-15c7-41d0-bef3-7ba2fba86c0f', 'commentary__0': None, 'translation__1': "Through the blessings of the Lord, the imperishable Sambhu is attained. The virtuous sages, such as Sanaka, attain the bliss of Brahman through the b ... (118 characters truncated) ...  the Lord's name, are blessed by Him, and Prahlada is among them. Dhruva, by chanting the Lord's name, attains the unshakeable and unparalleled Lord.", 'generated_by__1': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__1': 'English', 'id__1': 'e3b984ce-0bc9-4c2d-bc06-c66f7da48086', 'text_id__1': 'c5f2a19c-15c7-41d0-bef3-7ba2fba86c0f', 'commentary__1': None, 'translation__2': 'दसमुख सकल कथा तेहि आगें, कही सहित अभिमान अभागें। होहु कपट मृग तुम्ह छलकारी, जेहि बिधि हरि आनौ नृपनारी। तेहिं पुनि कहा सुनहु दससीसा, ते नररुप चराचर ईसा। तासों तात बयरु नहिं कीजे, मारें मरिअ जिआएँ जीजे।', 'generated_by__2': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__2': 'Hindi', 'id__2': '8a4e5f0c-89e0-42fe-a8c3-5d60bfd498d3', 'text_id__2': '9fd1af99-4861-4e17-bdfe-2731bd77b289', 'commentary__2': None, 'translation__3': "The ten-headed Ravana narrates the entire story, but with pride and regret. He, like a deceitful deer, is deceived by the Lord in the same way. The t ... (38 characters truncated) ... o this story, O Ravana, who has taken the form of the entire universe.' But, my dear father, do not show mercy, and let us kill them, and let us die.", 'generated_by__3': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__3': 'English', 'id__3': '77c3a672-03d8-4083-8845-3cb8bb4e5b0e', 'text_id__3': '9fd1af99-4861-4e17-bdfe-2731bd77b289', 'commentary__3': None, 'translation__4': 'जासु कृपा कटाच्छु सुर चाहत चितव न सोइ। राम पदारबिंद रति करति सुभावहि खोइ।', 'generated_by__4': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__4': 'Hindi', 'id__4': '84f228bc-cb70-4d70-a218-af40d546ec54', 'text_id__4': 'f1adcbde-5663-41d7-9a30-ece9f7b7b9fe', 'commentary__4': None, 'translation__5': "One who is blessed by the Lord's mercy, does not forget the Lord's lotus feet. The devotee, who is enchanted by the Lord's beauty, loses himself in the Lord's good qualities.", 'generated_by__5': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__5': 'English', 'id__5': '5996deb3-abd5-491f-b4c7-baa7a3bf66d7', 'text_id__5': 'f1adcbde-5663-41d7-9a30-ece9f7b7b9fe', 'commentary__5': None, 'translation__6': 'सेन सहित तब मान मथि बन उजारि पुर जारि, कस रे सठ हनुमान कपि गयउ जो तव सुत मारि।', 'generated_by__6': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__6': 'Hindi', 'id__6': '8d37c9e7-ff47-4b01-9ee2-c0d0e2c4e88d', 'text_id__6': '4f7987b8-a7d4-4b4c-a21b-50e0fb5ab9ca', 'commentary__6': None, 'translation__7': 'The city of Lanka was illuminated, and the army was defeated, but Hanuman, the monkey, went to the city, and killed Ravana, your son.', 'generated_by__7': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__7': 'English', 'id__7': '6084f0ae-ae83-45f5-875f-7ba6fcd548e7', 'text_id__7': '4f7987b8-a7d4-4b4c-a21b-50e0fb5ab9ca', 'commentary__7': None, 'translation__8': 'इहाँ बिचारहिं कपि मन माहीं, बीती अवधि काज कछु नाहीं। सब मिलि कहहिं परस्पर बाता, बिनु सुधि लएँ करब का भ्राता।', 'generated_by__8': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__8': 'Hindi', 'id__8': '80770c51-de18-4e4e-a53a-cab51d0a4602', 'text_id__8': 'a66c826d-c19f-4d84-aae8-27d0da488846', 'commentary__8': None, 'translation__9': "The monkeys here are thinking in their minds, 'We have not done anything in this past era.' They all gathered and discussed among themselves, 'Without understanding, we have killed our brother, Ravana.'", 'generated_by__9': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__9': 'English', 'id__9': 'bc60f3b5-cf76-4aea-8480-124046a0873f', 'text_id__9': 'a66c826d-c19f-4d84-aae8-27d0da488846', 'commentary__9': None, 'translation__10': 'तात राम कहुँ नर जनि मानहु। निर्गुन ब्रम्ह अजित अज जानहु। हम सब सेवक अति बड़भागी। संतत सगुन ब्रह्म अनुरागी।', 'generated_by__10': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__10': 'Hindi', 'id__10': '01a3ac05-5ce8-44de-9d9d-fcc3873b5150', 'text_id__10': 'tatah', 'commentary__10': None, 'translation__11': "My dear father, Rama says, 'Understand that the Lord is beyond all qualities, and is the unchanging and unshakeable Brahman.' We, His servants, are extremely fortunate. We have developed love for the benevolent Brahman.", 'generated_by__11': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__11': 'English', 'id__11': 'd433f12b-fd63-44f3-9e17-a1df57307a70', 'text_id__11': 'tatah', 'commentary__11': None}]
