[parameters: {'translation__0': 'मागु मागु पै कहहु पिय कबहुँ न देहु न लेहु। देन कहेहु बरदान दुइ तेउ पावत संदेहु।', 'generated_by__0': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__0': 'Hindi', 'id__0': 'e86fe648-1eda-4d0a-946c-022fa3de5b52', 'text_id__0': '5a2454b7-4c14-4340-84cd-d8e19c0b8e9f', 'commentary__0': None, 'translation__1': "Ask me, ask me, dear one, never give or take. Say, 'I give, I take,' and be free from doubt.", 'generated_by__1': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__1': 'English', 'id__1': 'a6a9ca14-52ad-41fa-9256-1209b72a7ed7', 'text_id__1': '5a2454b7-4c14-4340-84cd-d8e19c0b8e9f', 'commentary__1': None, 'translation__2': 'निज परम प्रीतम देखि लोचन सुफल करि सुख पाइहौं। श्री सहित अनुज समेत कृपानिकेत पद मन लाइहौं। निर्बान दायक क्रोध जा कर भगति अबसहि बसकरी। निज पानि सर संधानि सो मोहि बधिहि सुखसागर हरी।', 'generated_by__2': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__2': 'Hindi', 'id__2': 'e148eedb-ccc7-4e3f-8a4b-fd05f79544d3', 'text_id__2': 'd90f8198-1489-4b45-9ee0-2ca476d8129e', 'commentary__2': None, 'translation__3': 'See your beloved with your eyes, and enjoy the fruit of happiness. With the Lord, along with your brother, take refuge in the lotus feet, and be free from the ocean of suffering. Leave anger and be devoted, and reside in the Lord, who is the remover of all suffering.', 'generated_by__3': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__3': 'English', 'id__3': '3aa38e98-a244-4d45-be2a-77f8b0c3e09a', 'text_id__3': 'd90f8198-1489-4b45-9ee0-2ca476d8129e', 'commentary__3': None, 'translation__4': 'प्रातकाल सरऊ करि मज्जन। बैठहिं सभाँ संग द्विज सज्जन। बेद पुरान बसिष्ट बखानहिं। सुनहिं राम जद्यपि सब जानहिं। अनुजन्ह संजुत भोजन करहीं। देखि सकल जननीं  ... (126 characters truncated) ...  पावहिं। बहुरि बहुरि करि विनय कहावहिं। सब कें गृह गृह होहिं पुराना। रामचरित पावन बिधि नाना। नर अरु नारि राम गुन गानहिं। करहिं दिवस निसि जात न जानहिं।', 'generated_by__4': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__4': 'Hindi', 'id__4': '9fa916dc-89a0-42ef-adef-42caac763ba2', 'text_id__4': 'a87b7ec3-0c84-4bd0-bea6-13fc7cf3fb03', 'commentary__4': None, 'translation__5': "In the morning, they take a bath, and sit together with the twice-born gentlemen. They narrate the ancient scriptures, and listen to Rama, even thoug ... (374 characters truncated) ... the old people become young. The ways of Rama's deeds are pure and varied. Men and women sing Rama's virtues, and do not know the time, day or night.", 'generated_by__5': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__5': 'English', 'id__5': '0c2ec219-92d1-46dc-96a4-1668de95854c', 'text_id__5': 'a87b7ec3-0c84-4bd0-bea6-13fc7cf3fb03', 'commentary__5': None, 'translation__6': 'सठ साखामृग जोरि सहाई। बाँधा सिंधु इहइ प्रभुताई। नाघहिं खग अनेक बारीसा। सूर न होहिं ते सुनु सब कीसा। मम भुज सागर बल जल पूरा। जहँ बूड़े बहु सुर नर सूरा ... (115 characters truncated) ... तव नाथा। पुनि पुनि कहसि जासु गुन गाथा। तौ बसीठ पठवत केहि काजा। रिपु सन प्रीति करत नहिं लाजा। हरगिरि मथन निरखु मम बाहू। पुनि सठ कपि निज प्रभुहि सराहू।', 'generated_by__6': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__6': 'Hindi', 'id__6': 'f944c9c1-a7dc-4772-98f8-bd6e51c73498', 'text_id__6': '63fdc7f7-1dd9-44f0-85b2-06e5dfb614af', 'commentary__6': None, 'translation__7': 'The monkey, the deer, and the elephant are tied with a rope. The river is bound by the power of the Lord. The birds, who are many, do not know the tr ... (341 characters truncated) ... y of your virtues. Then, sitting, I will do some work. I will not be ashamed in front of my enemies. Look at my arms, O monkey, and praise your Lord.', 'generated_by__7': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__7': 'English', 'id__7': '87bd4c3e-1f06-464d-a74c-028f3b8e6da1', 'text_id__7': '63fdc7f7-1dd9-44f0-85b2-06e5dfb614af', 'commentary__7': None, 'translation__8': 'अनुज क्रिया करि सागर तीरा। कहि निज कथा सुनहु कपि बीरा। हम द्वौ बंधु प्रथम तरुनाई । गगन गए रबि निकट उडाई। तेज न सहि सक सो फिरि आवा। मै अभिमानी रबि निअ ... (342 characters truncated) ... कइ गिरा सत्य भइ आजू । सुनि मम बचन करहु प्रभु काजू। गिरि त्रिकूट ऊपर बस लंका । तहँ रह रावन सहज असंका । तहँ असोक उपबन जहँ रहई ।। सीता बैठि सोच रत अहई।।', 'generated_by__8': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__8': 'Hindi', 'id__8': '5bec3004-d071-4a34-b0ae-1ed64f5fa35e', 'text_id__8': 'febc3426-a3fa-417d-bcc3-a735d6192dc4', 'commentary__8': None, 'translation__9': "The monkey, the brave one, performs the action of the sea shore. Tell me, dear monkey, listen to my story. My two brothers and I, in our youth, flew  ... (619 characters truncated) ...  work.' The mountain Trikuta has Lanka on top. Ravana, the fearless one, lives there. There, the Ashoka tree, where Sita sits, thinking and worrying.", 'generated_by__9': 'groq-llama-3.1-8b-instant', 'language__9': 'English', 'id__9': '1d1787ed-e52c-48ce-bad2-4acdda13ba4a', 'text_id__9': 'febc3426-a3fa-417d-bcc3-a735d6192dc4', 'commentary__9': None}]
